What:           /sys/devices/platform/1000a000.crypto/state
Date:           October 2026
Contact:        FuQuan233
Description:
                Read-only software counters for MT6580 HACC software-key
                AES. broken latches a hardware READY timeout until reprobe
                or reboot. requests counts completed queued requests; bytes
                counts successful request bytes; blocks also includes the
                two probe-time AES known-answer operations. errors counts
                failed queued requests and timeouts counts READY deadlines.
                pm resumes/suspends count runtime clock transitions.
                API rejections before queueing are not included. Counters
                are individually sampled, not one atomic snapshot. Reading
                does not access gated MMIO, disclose key/data registers or
                report measured electrical power.
